#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How to create and manage access groups for your organization's account "
"users."
msgstr ""
"Paano lumikha at pamahalaan ang mga access group para sa mga user ng account"
" ng iyong organisasyon."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create access groups and policies"
msgstr "Lumikha ng mga access group at policy"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Create access groups and policies {#create-access-groups-and-policies}"
msgstr ""
"Lumikha ng mga access group at policy {#create-access-groups-and-policies}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When you create an instance in IBM Quantum&reg; Platform, an access group is"
" automatically generated for collaborators to use that instance. If you want"
" to customize that access group or create other access groups, use the "
"IBM&reg; Cloud console for [Access "
"groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kapag lumikha ka ng instance sa IBM Quantum&reg; Platform, awtomatikong "
"nalilikha ang isang access group para magamit ng mga collaborator ang "
"instance na iyon. Kung gusto mong i-customize ang access group na iyon o "
"lumikha ng ibang mga access group, gamitin ang IBM&reg; Cloud console para "
"sa [Access groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An _access group_ contains _policies_, which define the actions that access "
"group members can take on specific resources, such as services.  In this "
"guide, the resource is generally an IBM Quantum _service instance_.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang isang _access group_ ay naglalaman ng mga _policy_, na nagtatakda ng mga"
" aksyon na maaaring gawin ng mga miyembro ng access group sa mga partikular "
"na resource, tulad ng mga serbisyo. Sa gabay na ito, ang resource ay "
"karaniwang isang IBM Quantum _service instance_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can create additional access groups by using the IBM Cloud&reg; "
"[console](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"groups&interface=ui), "
"[CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"groups&interface=cli), "
"[API](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"groups&interface=api), or "
"[Terraform](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"groups&interface=terraform).\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari kang lumikha ng karagdagang mga access group gamit ang IBM Cloud&reg;"
" [console](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"groups&interface=ui), "
"[CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"groups&interface=cli), "
"[API](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"groups&interface=api), o "
"[Terraform](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"groups&interface=terraform).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Important\">\n"
"To determine the actions allowed by each role, from the [IAM Roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles) page, select Qiskit Runtime in the dropdown menu at the top of the page.  For a more detailed list, click the number in the column next to the role name.  For example, by visiting that page and clicking the number by the Manager role, you can see that this role includes the ability to delete a job (`quantum-computing.job.delete`).\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Mahalaga\">\n"
"Para malaman ang mga aksyon na pinapayagan ng bawat role, mula sa pahina ng [IAM Roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles), piliin ang Qiskit Runtime sa dropdown menu sa itaas ng pahina. Para sa mas detalyadong listahan, i-click ang numero sa kolum na katabi ng pangalan ng role. Halimbawa, sa pamamagitan ng pagbisita sa pahinang iyon at pag-click sa numero sa tabi ng Manager role, makikita mo na kasama sa role na ito ang kakayahang mag-delete ng job (`quantum-computing.job.delete`).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Compare pre-defined service role actions](#compare-actions) section provides a comparison of the pre-defined Manager, Writer, and Reader roles.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang seksyong [Ikumpara ang mga pre-defined service role action](#compare-actions) ay nagbibigay ng paghahambing ng mga pre-defined na Manager, Writer, at Reader role.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"create-ibm-quantum-administrators\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"create-ibm-quantum-administrators\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an IBM Quantum Administrators access group {#create-an-ibm-quantum-"
"administrators-access-group}"
msgstr ""
"Lumikha ng IBM Quantum Administrators access group {#create-an-ibm-quantum-"
"administrators-access-group}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After setting up an account for your organization, it's recommended that you"
" create an IBM Quantum Administrators access group. This access group lets "
"other users create and manage instances, and manage user access for the "
"Qiskit Runtime service.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos mag-set up ng account para sa iyong organisasyon, inirerekomenda "
"na lumikha ka ng IBM Quantum Administrators access group. Ang access group "
"na ito ay nagbibigay-daan sa ibang mga user na lumikha at pamahalaan ang mga"
" instance, at pamahalaan ang access ng user para sa Qiskit Runtime "
"service.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "When you create this access group, include the following policies:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kapag lumikha ka ng access group na ito, isama ang mga sumusunod na "
"policy:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Runtime service - Grant access to manage all IBM Quantum instances in"
" the account and view account usage analytics.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit Runtime service — Bigyan ng access para pamahalaan ang lahat ng IBM "
"Quantum instance sa account at tingnan ang analytics ng paggamit ng "
"account.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Manager** service access role\n"
msgstr "**Manager** service access role\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Administrator** platform management access role\n"
msgstr "**Administrator** platform management access role\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All account management services - Grant access to list all the resource "
"groups in the account.\n"
msgstr ""
"All account management services — Bigyan ng access para ilista ang lahat ng "
"resource group sa account.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Viewer** platform management access role\n"
msgstr "**Viewer** platform management access role\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All IAM Account Management services - Grant access to invite users, manage "
"access groups, and create access policies.\n"
msgstr ""
"All IAM Account Management services — Bigyan ng access para mag-imbitasyon "
"ng mga user, pamahalaan ang mga access group, at lumikha ng mga access "
"policy.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Support Center service - Grant access to enable users to open support cases "
"through IBM Cloud Support Center.\n"
msgstr ""
"Support Center service — Bigyan ng access para mapayagan ang mga user na "
"magbukas ng mga support case sa pamamagitan ng IBM Cloud Support Center.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Users with the `viewer` platform management role on \"all account "
"management services\" can also view services such as billing. If you want to"
" prevent this extra view access, use the IBM Cloud CLI to give them access "
"to just Resource groups:\n"
msgstr ""
"  Ang mga user na may `viewer` platform management role sa \"all account "
"management services\" ay maaari ring tingnan ang mga serbisyo tulad ng "
"billing. Kung gusto mong pigilan ang karagdagang view access na ito, gamitin"
" ang IBM Cloud CLI para bigyan sila ng access sa Resource groups lamang:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr "</DoqAdmonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow these examples to create an IBM Quantum Administrators access group "
"by using the IBM Cloud CLI or console.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sundin ang mga halimbawang ito para lumikha ng IBM Quantum Administrators "
"access group gamit ang IBM Cloud CLI o console.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cli\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cli\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use the IBM Cloud CLI {#use-the-ibm-cloud-cli}"
msgstr "Gamitin ang IBM Cloud CLI {#use-the-ibm-cloud-cli}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To create an _access group_ by using the CLI, use the [`ibmcloud iam access-"
"group-create`](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-"
"ibmcloud_commands_iam#ibmcloud_iam_access_group_policy_create) command.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para lumikha ng _access group_ gamit ang CLI, gamitin ang command na "
"[`ibmcloud iam access-group-"
"create`](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-"
"ibmcloud_commands_iam#ibmcloud_iam_access_group_policy_create).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To create an access group _policy_ by using the CLI, use the [`ibmcloud iam "
"access-group-policy-create`](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-"
"ibmcloud_commands_iam#ibmcloud_iam_access_group_policy_create) command.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para lumikha ng _policy_ ng access group gamit ang CLI, gamitin ang command "
"na [`ibmcloud iam access-group-policy-"
"create`](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-"
"ibmcloud_commands_iam#ibmcloud_iam_access_group_policy_create).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use the following JSON code to create policies for an Administrators"
" access group:\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong gamitin ang sumusunod na JSON code para lumikha ng mga policy "
"para sa isang Administrators access group:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "All Account Management services (viewer)\n"
msgstr "All Account Management services (viewer)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime Service (Manager, Administrator)\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Runtime Service (Manager, Administrator)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "All IAM Account Management services (administrator)\n"
msgstr "All IAM Account Management services (administrator)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Support Center service (administrator)\n"
msgstr "Support Center service (administrator)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"ui\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"ui\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use the IBM Cloud IAM console {#use-the-ibm-cloud-iam-console}"
msgstr "Gamitin ang IBM Cloud IAM console {#use-the-ibm-cloud-iam-console}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As an account owner or administrator, follow these steps to create an IBM "
"Quantum Administrator access group.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bilang may-ari ng account o administrator, sundin ang mga hakbang na ito "
"para lumikha ng IBM Quantum Administrator access group.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to Manage > [Access (IAM)](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/overview) in the IBM"
" Cloud console.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pumunta sa Manage > [Access (IAM)](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/overview) sa "
"IBM Cloud console.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On the left panel in the **Manage access** section, click **Access groups**,"
" then click **Create**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa kaliwang panel sa seksyong **Manage access**, i-click ang **Access "
"groups**, pagkatapos i-click ang **Create**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the **Create access group** window that opens, add a name and description"
" that represent the group of users that you will invite.  For example, IBM "
"Quantum Administrators. Click **Create**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa window na **Create access group** na magbubukas, magdagdag ng pangalan at"
" paglalarawan na kumakatawan sa grupo ng mga user na iimbitahan mo. "
"Halimbawa, IBM Quantum Administrators. I-click ang **Create**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, create policies for the Qiskit Runtime service,  for All IAM Account Management services, and for All Account Management services.\n"
"1. In the access group just created, click the **Access** tab, then click **Assign access**.\n"
"1. In the **Create policy** page that opens, define these elements:\n"
"   - **Service** - Search for Qiskit Runtime and select it. Click **Next**.\n"
"   - **Resources** - Select **All resources**. Click **Next**.\n"
"      Note: If you were creating a policy that you want to apply only to a certain instance, you would instead choose **Specific resources**, **Service instance**, **string equals**, then select the instance.\n"
"   - **Roles and actions** - Select the following values:\n"
"      - For **Service access**, select  **Manager**.\n"
"      - For **Platform access**, select **Administrator**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Susunod, lumikha ng mga policy para sa Qiskit Runtime service, para sa All IAM Account Management services, at para sa All Account Management services.\n"
"1. Sa access group na kabubukas lang, i-click ang tab na **Access**, pagkatapos i-click ang **Assign access**.\n"
"1. Sa pahina ng **Create policy** na magbubukas, tukuyin ang mga elementong ito:\n"
"   - **Service** — Hanapin ang Qiskit Runtime at piliin ito. I-click ang **Next**.\n"
"   - **Resources** — Piliin ang **All resources**. I-click ang **Next**.\n"
"      Tandaan: Kung lumilikha ka ng policy na gusto mong ilapat lamang sa isang partikular na instance, pipiliin mo ang **Specific resources**, **Service instance**, **string equals**, pagkatapos piliin ang instance.\n"
"   - **Roles and actions** — Piliin ang mga sumusunod na value:\n"
"      - Para sa **Service access**, piliin ang **Manager**.\n"
"      - Para sa **Platform access**, piliin ang **Administrator**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   At the bottom, click **Add**. You should see the policy on the right-hand"
" panel. Click **Assign** at the bottom of that panel.\n"
msgstr ""
"   Sa ibaba, i-click ang **Add**. Makikita mo ang policy sa kanang panel. "
"I-click ang **Assign** sa ibaba ng panel na iyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You have successfully created an access group with one policy.  Next, create"
" a second policy for the same instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Matagumpay kang nakalikha ng access group na may isang policy. Susunod, "
"lumikha ng pangalawang policy para sa parehong instance.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the same access group, click the **Access** tab, then click **Assign "
"access**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa parehong access group, i-click ang tab na **Access**, pagkatapos i-click "
"ang **Assign access**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In the **Create policy** page that opens, define these elements:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa pahina ng **Create policy** na magbubukas, tukuyin ang mga elementong "
"ito:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Service** - Select **All IAM Account Management services**. Click "
"**Next**.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Service** — Piliin ang **All IAM Account Management services**. I-click "
"ang **Next**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   - **Roles and actions** - For Platform access, select **Administrator**, Click **Next**.\n"
"   At the bottom, click **Add**, then click **Assign**.\n"
msgstr ""
"   - **Roles and actions** — Para sa Platform access, piliin ang **Administrator**. I-click ang **Next**.\n"
"   Sa ibaba, i-click ang **Add**, pagkatapos i-click ang **Assign**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Create a third policy for the same instance.\n"
msgstr "Lumikha ng ikatlong policy para sa parehong instance.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Service** - Select **All Account Management services**. Click **Next**.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Service** — Piliin ang **All Account Management services**. I-click ang "
"**Next**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   - **Roles and actions** - For Platform access, select **Viewer**, Click **Next**.\n"
"   At the bottom, click **Add**, then click **Assign**.\n"
msgstr ""
"   - **Roles and actions** — Para sa Platform access, piliin ang **Viewer**. I-click ang **Next**.\n"
"   Sa ibaba, i-click ang **Add**, pagkatapos i-click ang **Assign**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Create a fourth policy for the same instance.\n"
msgstr "Lumikha ng ikaapat na policy para sa parehong instance.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Service** - Select **Support Center**. Click **Next**.\n"
msgstr "**Service** — Piliin ang **Support Center**. I-click ang **Next**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   - **Roles and actions** - For Platform access, select **Administrator**. Click **Next**.\n"
"   At the bottom, click **Add**, then click **Assign**.\n"
msgstr ""
"   - **Roles and actions** — Para sa Platform access, piliin ang **Administrator**. I-click ang **Next**.\n"
"   Sa ibaba, i-click ang **Add**, pagkatapos i-click ang **Assign**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, add users to the access group.  You can do this from the access "
"group's **Users** page, or by using the IBM Quantum Platform [Access "
"management](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/access-groups) page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa wakas, magdagdag ng mga user sa access group. Maaari mong gawin ito mula "
"sa pahina ng **Users** ng access group, o sa pamamagitan ng pahina ng "
"[Access management](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/access-groups) ng IBM "
"Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"You can only invite users who are already members of the account.  If you don't see a user on the Add users page, follow the steps in [Invite and manage users](/guides/invite-and-manage-users#invite) to add them to the account first.  After they accept the invitation, you can add them to the access group.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Maaari ka lamang mag-imbitasyon ng mga user na miyembro na ng account. Kung hindi mo makita ang isang user sa pahina ng Add users, sundin ang mga hakbang sa [Imbitahan at pamahalaan ang mga user](/guides/invite-and-manage-users#invite) para idagdag sila sa account muna. Pagkatapos tanggapin nila ang imbitasyon, maaari mo na silang idagdag sa access group.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Compare permissions {#compare-permissions}"
msgstr "Ikumpara ang mga pahintulot {#compare-permissions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following table displays which permissions are granted to three "
"entities: account owners, IBM Quantum Administrators (see the [Create an IBM"
" Quantum Administrators access group](#create-ibm-quantum-administrators) "
"section), and instance collaborators (a \"Collaborators\" access group is "
"automatically generated whenever you create an instance using IBM Quantum "
"Platform).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang sumusunod na talahanayan ay nagpapakita kung aling mga pahintulot ang "
"ipinagkaloob sa tatlong entity: mga may-ari ng account, IBM Quantum "
"Administrators (tingnan ang seksyong [Lumikha ng IBM Quantum Administrators "
"access group](#create-ibm-quantum-administrators)), at mga instance "
"collaborator (awtomatikong nalilikha ang \"Collaborators\" access group "
"tuwing lumilikha ka ng instance gamit ang IBM Quantum Platform).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Key:\n"
msgstr "Susi:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "✅ Has permission\n"
msgstr "✅ May pahintulot\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "✴️ Involves a dependency\n"
msgstr "✴️ May dependency\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "❌ Does not have permission\n"
msgstr "❌ Walang pahintulot\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Permissions | Account owner | IBM Quantum Administrators (access group) | Instance collaborators (access group) |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Full access to all IBM Cloud resources | ✅| ✅ (*Only to Qiskit Runtime instances*)| ❌ (*Only to a particular Qiskit Runtime instance*)| \n"
"| Assign access to others | ✅| ✅ (*Only to Qiskit Runtime service*)| ❌| \n"
"| Create service instances  | ✅ (*All IBM Cloud catalog*)| ✅ (*Only Qiskit Runtime service instances*)| ❌| \n"
"| View all users | ✅| ✅| ✴️ (*Depends on user visibility settings*)| \n"
"| Set user visibility | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
"| Invite users to the account | ✅| ✅| ❌| \n"
"| Billing responsibility | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
"| View billing information | ✅| ✅| ❌| \n"
"| Owner notifications | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
"| Submit quantum workloads | ✅ (*On all Qiskit Runtime instances*)| ✅ (*On all Qiskit Runtime instances*)| ✅ (*Only on a particular Qiskit Runtime instance*) | \n"
"| View quantum workloads | ✅ (*On all Qiskit Runtime instances*)| ✅ (*On all Qiskit Runtime instances*)| ✅ (*Only on a particular Qiskit Runtime instance*)| \n"
"| Cancel quantum workloads | ✅ (*On all Qiskit Runtime instances*)| ✅ (*On all Qiskit Runtime instances*)| ✅ (*Only on a particular Qiskit Runtime instance*)| \n"
"| Delete quantum workloads | ✅ (*On all Qiskit Runtime instances*)| ✅ (*On all Qiskit Runtime instances*) | ❌| \n"
"| Create support cases | ✅| ✅ (*If the access policy is included in the access group*) | ✅ (*If the access group gives access to a Premium Plan instance*)| \n"
"| Configure an [identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/identity-providers) to connect your external user repositories to your IBM Cloud account | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
msgstr ""
"| Mga Pahintulot | May-ari ng account | IBM Quantum Administrators (access group) | Mga instance collaborator (access group) |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Buong access sa lahat ng IBM Cloud resource | ✅| ✅ (*Sa mga Qiskit Runtime instance lamang*)| ❌ (*Sa isang partikular na Qiskit Runtime instance lamang*)|\n"
"| Mag-assign ng access sa iba | ✅| ✅ (*Sa Qiskit Runtime service lamang*)| ❌|\n"
"| Lumikha ng mga service instance | ✅ (*Lahat ng IBM Cloud catalog*)| ✅ (*Qiskit Runtime service instance lamang*)| ❌|\n"
"| Tingnan ang lahat ng user | ✅| ✅| ✴️ (*Depende sa mga setting ng visibility ng user*)|\n"
"| I-set ang visibility ng user | ✅| ❌| ❌|\n"
"| Imbitahan ang mga user sa account | ✅| ✅| ❌|\n"
"| Responsibilidad sa billing | ✅| ❌| ❌|\n"
"| Tingnan ang impormasyon sa billing | ✅| ✅| ❌|\n"
"| Mga notification ng may-ari | ✅| ❌| ❌|\n"
