#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"compare-actions\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"compare-actions\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compare pre-defined service role actions {#compare-pre-defined-service-role-"
"actions}"
msgstr ""
"Ikumpara ang mga pre-defined service role action {#compare-pre-defined-"
"service-role-actions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following table displays examples of actions that can be taken by the "
"pre-defined service role actions: Manager, Writer, and Reader. To see a "
"complete mapping of Quantum Service roles to actions, visit [this "
"table](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iam-service-roles-"
"actions#quantum-computing-roles) in the IBM Cloud Product guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang sumusunod na talahanayan ay nagpapakita ng mga halimbawa ng mga aksyon "
"na maaaring gawin ng mga pre-defined service role: Manager, Writer, at "
"Reader. Para makita ang kumpletong mapa ng mga Quantum Service role sa mga "
"aksyon, bisitahin ang [talahanayan na "
"ito](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iam-service-roles-"
"actions#quantum-computing-roles) sa IBM Cloud Product guide.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Action | Description | Roles |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.session.create` | Create a Session/Batch | Manager, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.create` | Submit a Job | Manager, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.read` | Read a result | Manager, Reader, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.cancel` | Cancel a job | Manager, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.delete` | Delete a job | Manager |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-backend-properties.read` | Read QPU calibrations | Manager, Reader, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.account-analytics-usage.read` | See account analytics | Manager, Writer (*Only if role is set up for all resources*) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.instance-usage.read` | See instance usage and remaining time | Manager, Reader, Writer |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Aksyon | Paglalarawan | Mga Role |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.session.create` | Lumikha ng Session/Batch | Manager, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.create` | Mag-submit ng Job | Manager, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.read` | Basahin ang resulta | Manager, Reader, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.cancel` | Kanselahin ang job | Manager, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.delete` | I-delete ang job | Manager |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-backend-properties.read` | Basahin ang mga QPU calibration | Manager, Reader, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.account-analytics-usage.read` | Tingnan ang analytics ng account | Manager, Writer (*Kung naka-set up ang role para sa lahat ng resource lamang*) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.instance-usage.read` | Tingnan ang paggamit ng instance at natitirang oras | Manager, Reader, Writer |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"   - Understand the [IBM Cloud account structure](/guides/cloud-account-structure), including access policies, groups, and roles.\n"
"   - Read about [how IBM Cloud IAM works](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iamoverview).\n"
"   - Read more about how to [set up access groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=ui).\n"
"   - Understand the the [IAM Roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles) (select Qiskit Runtime from the dropdown at the top of the page).\n"
"   - Learn about [creating custom roles](/guides/custom-roles).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga Rekomendasyon\">\n"
"   - Alamin ang [istraktura ng IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-account-structure), kasama ang mga access policy, grupo, at role.\n"
"   - Basahin ang [kung paano gumagana ang IBM Cloud IAM](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iamoverview).\n"
"   - Basahin ang higit pa tungkol sa kung paano [mag-set up ng mga access group](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=ui).\n"
"   - Alamin ang [IAM Roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles) (piliin ang Qiskit Runtime mula sa dropdown sa itaas ng pahina).\n"
"   - Alamin ang tungkol sa [paglikha ng mga custom role](/guides/custom-roles).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
